    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="IdealChain gives the exact random-walk result \langle R^2\rangle=nb^2. RealChain scales instead as R\sim bn^\nu, with the Flory exponent \nu set by solvent quality: a good solvent swells the chain (\nu\approx0.6), a poor solvent collapses it (\nu=1/3), and the theta solvent reproduces the ideal chain exactly (\nu=1/2).">

